Hi everybody

I found one solution for my problem.

My $HOME directory is mounted with NFS.

The problem seems to be between NFS and the Korn Shell.

I "solve" this problem with the following entries in my ".profile" file.

HISTFILE=/tmp/.history.$$
export HISTFILE

I have to place my .history outside my $HOME.

I'm still interested about a good explanation about that NFS/Korn Problem.

Best regards,

Stephane




