went ahead and recompiled the kernel (had to after making other
configuration changes).  We ended up putting the UBC settings back to
default and are looking at other settings.

dbx -k /vmunix
(dbx) pd ufs_getapage_stats

(read_hits / read_looks) * 100 = UBC hit rate 




