thank you for the answers to:
Keith Texel, Daniel Clar, Olle Eriksson and Bobby Cheema

The solution:

You will need to remove all patches that you have applied
between PK2 and PK3. A CSP's and ERP's  are hot fixes that are
released between the patch kits.

