====================================================
Step 5:  Configuration of SG
====================================================

1. create a simple configuration file
-------------------------------------
   /usr/local/squidGuard/etc/squidguard.conf

       logdir /usr/local/squidGuard/logs
       dbhome /usr/local/squidGuard/db

       destination porn {
                         domainlist porn/domains
                         urllist    porn/urls
                         log        porn.log
       }

       acl {
                default {
                    pass !porn all
